    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Coming Soon **\r\n\r\nBrendan Kearns, Hills Property, is pleased to present Apartment 15, Stone Park, a bright and spacious top-floor apartment situated within this well-maintained and highly regarded residential development in the heart of Glenties."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Occupying an elevated position, this impressive two-bedroom apartment enjoys excellent views over Glenties and the surrounding countryside, while the thoughtfully designed layout maximises natural light throughout the property.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hall, a large open-plan kitchen/dining/living room with balcony access, two double bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite and private balcony, a main bathroom and a substantial loft room with Velux window providing valuable additional space.\r\n\r\nThe living accommodation is a particular highlight. A striking feature window seat, surrounded by glazing on three sides, creates a bright and inviting space from which to enjoy the views. The kitchen benefits from a corner window and Velux roof window, flooding the room with natural light, while skylights in both the main bathroom and ensuite further enhance the bright and airy feel throughout the apartment.\r\n\r\nStonepark is a modern apartment development that has been exceptionally well maintained. Residents benefit from lift access, bright and spacious communal corridors, ample parking and a secure ground-floor storage room allocated to each apartment, providing excellent additional storage.\r\n\r\nConveniently located within walking distance of Glenties town centre, local shops, schools, sporting facilities and everyday amenities, this property will appeal to owner-occupiers, holiday home buyers and investors alike.\r\n\r\n** More details to follow **"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing by appointment only.  For all enquiries, please contact Brendan at Hills Property on 085 1773362."
      }
    ],
